From 469aadcd5a619672221d1244ed9908ba1292dfc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:32:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix live check-in bug; add Day-tab shortcut and clickable
 outstanding stat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- profiles.location_lat/location_lng were never added by any prior
  migration even though start_dealer_visit() has always assumed they
  exist, so every real check-in attempt failed with "column
  p.location_lat does not exist". Adds them (idempotent).
- Once the day is active, the dashboard header now shows both "Day"
  and "Check In" buttons side by side instead of only "Check In", so
  the Day tab (End Day, Day Activity log) stays reachable — DayCheckIn
  now honors an explicit tab passed via navigation state.
- "Total outstanding" stat card is now clickable and scrolls to the
  My Dealers / Parties list, which already shows each dealer's own
  outstanding amount.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
